# Git 统一保存文本行尾，避免 Windows 与其他环境产生无意义差异。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.hlsl text eol=lf
*.hlsli text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
*.textproto text eol=lf
*.gltf text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf

# 模型、纹理及世界二进制必须保留原始字节。
*.pb binary
*.rgba binary
*.dds binary
*.png binary
*.bmp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.blend binary
*.pmx binary
*.glb binary
